      "updated": 1794268800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is a conceptual source-managed pattern, not a universal transport diagram. SQL MI's 2022-policy CDC and Oracle Mirror\nPublisher have different gateway roles; Cosmos DB's restricted-account gateway does not carry its ongoing replication stream.",
      "originalText": "This is a conceptual source-managed pattern, not a universal transport diagram. SQL MI's 2022-policy CDC and Oracle Mirror Publisher have different gateway roles; Cosmos DB's restricted-account gateway does not carry its ongoing replication stream.",
